      "fill": "teal",
      "text": "Same design system, data, actions and flows as today. Only density, placement and grouping change.\n\nTicket list: compact one-line rows, a Due column with the SLA chip, and views in the title menu so the table gets the full width.\n\nTicket page: one-band header, reply bar always visible, compact properties.\n\nClick around: the views menu, a ticket, the reply bar and the bell work.",
